ainless (first choice), High temp. alloys; not for nonferrous, cast iron.", "UT": "For low feeds on CrNi alloys and low carbon steel; slightly tighter than UA. ~12° rake, 7° clearance. Feed f ≈ W insert / 40 mm/rev (neutral inserts; R/L: reduce by 20-40%). Materials: Alloy steel (first choice); not for austenitic stainless, high temp. alloys, nonferrous, cast iron.", "A": "Positive rake, sharp edge, for parting aluminum (grade IC20). 9° rake, 7° clearance. Feed f ≈ W insert / 43 mm/rev (neutral inserts; R/L: reduce by 20-40%). Materials: Nonferrous (first choice); not for alloy steel, austenitic stainless, high temp. alloys, cast iron.", "W": "Central ridged chipformer for hard materials and interrupted cuts. Materials: Alloy steel (first choice), Cast iron; not for austenitic stainless, high temp. alloys, nonferrous."}$ck$::jsonb, $ck$[]$ck$::jsonb), $ck$[{"title": "Chipformer selection for workpiece materials (Parting catalog) – ★ first choice, ✓ suitable, ✗ not recommended", "columns": ["Chipformer", "Alloy steel", "Austenitic stainless", "High temp. alloys", "Nonferrous", "Cast iron"], "rows": [["C", "★", "✗", "✓", "✓", "✓"], ["W", "★", "✗", "✗", "✗", "✓"], ["MF", "✓", "★", "★", "✗", "✓"], ["JT", "✓", "★", "✓", "✗", "✓"], ["J", "✓", "★", "✓", "✓", "✗"], ["Z", "✓", "★", "✓", "✓", "✗"], ["LFT", "✓", "★", "✓", "✗", "✗"], ["LF", "✓", "★", "✓", "✗", "✗"], ["UT", "★", "✗", "✗", "✗", "✗"], ["P", "★", "✓", "✗", "✓", "✗"], ["A", "✗", "✗", "✗", "★", "✗"], ["C-jet (coolant)", "✓", "✓", "★", "✗", "✗"]]}, {"title": "Recommended feed by chipformer: f ≈ W insert / factor [mm/rev] (neutral inserts; R/L: reduce by 20-40%)", "columns": ["Chipformer", "Factor", "Rake / clearance", "Typical feed range (mm/rev, approx.)"], "rows": [["C", "18", "~12° rake, 7° clearance", "0.13-0.25"], ["MF", "21", "12° rake", "0.07-0.20"], ["M", "22", "~12° rake, 7° clearance", ""], ["JT", "24", "5° rake, 7° clearance", ""], ["J", "26", "4° rake, 7° clearance", "0.05-0.11"], ["Z", "28", "11° rake, 7° clearance", ""], ["LF", "31", "0° rake, 7° clearance", "0.06-0.09"], ["UA", "40", "~12° rake, 7° clearance", ""], ["UT", "40", "~12° rake, 7° clearance", "0.03-0.07"], ["A", "43", "9° rake, 7° clearance", ""], ["P", "55", "13° rake, 7° clearance", ""]]}, {"title": "TANG-GRIP clamping / extraction keys (ETG)", "columns": ["Key", "For"], "rows": [["ETG 1.4", "1.4 mm tools"], ["ETG 2", "2 mm tools"], ["ETG 3-4", "3 and 4 mm tools"], ["ETG 5-7", "5-7 mm tools"], ["ETG 8-12", "Extractor for 8 to 12.7 mm inserts"]]}]$ck$::jsonb)::text
